msgctxt "76"
msgid "Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "Hey. What's going on?"
msgstr "Ehi. Come va?"

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"We gave all our money to this study abroad agent, and he, like, totally ran "
"off with it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "What? How?"
msgstr "Cosa? In che senso?"

msgctxt "124"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "Without that money, we can't go to Istanbul anymore..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "I'm so sorry, Ranko! I'm really, really sorry!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Let's start from the beginning. What happened?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"So I was gonna use this one study abroad agent to plan our trip, but Mina "
"said she found one who'd do it for way cheaper..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"So I canceled our contract with the old one and went over to the new guy, "
"and then, well..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"Mina tried to run off with the money we were gonna save from switching to "
"the new guy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "That's not true! I have the money right here, all two million!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "I was gonna split the money with you, Ranko!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Could you stop lying to my face!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "What happened to the rest of the money we've been saving up forever!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"Well, it's not like you were gonna actually live in Istanbul. Even if you "
"went, you'd probably just give up and come home within a week."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "What? How can you even say that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "Well, it's not like you ever asked for my opinion, Ranko!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"So now you get to hear it! You should give up on going to Istanbul and use "
"that money for something way more practical! It's for your own good!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "Mina..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"We can fight about this later. Right now, we gotta get our money back, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "Kiryu-san... Could you come with me to the agent's office?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr "E di che."

msgctxt "400"
msgid "Ohmigosh, thank you so much! You're the best, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

